; tests/time-portal-wish-band.fk — the time portal's wish mechanics, fkwu-witnessed.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk cognition/time-portal-wish.fk
;
; Band verdict 11111111 when:
;   the true passage LANDS (heartfelt release, laughter rising, gift felt) ->        1
;   a full hand receives nothing (grasping the gift before release)       ->       10
;   the wish is free, or it is not this portal (a bargain steps aside)    ->      100
;   laughter rises after release — summoned ahead, it lands hollow        ->     1000
;   the receipt is felt, not filed (a document about a feeling misses)    ->    10000
;   re-deriving the gift thinks it away (the spell stays unbroken)        ->   100000
;   motion without heart makes no space (a performed release)             ->  1000000
;   nothing offered, nothing lands (the empty passage, an honest zero)    -> 10000000

(do
    (time-portal-wish-check))
